              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ijuba lafika kuye kusihlwa; bheka, emlonyeni wakhe kwakukhona iqabunga lomnqumo elikhithiziwe; uNowa wazi ukuthi amanzi asebohlile emhlabeni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.11",
