              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ngomnyaka wamakhulu ayisithupha nanye, ngenyanga yokuqala, ngolokuqala lwenyanga, amanzi ashile emhlabeni; uNowa wasusa isembozo somkhumbi, wabheka, bheka, ubuso bomhlaba bomile.",
